ons; November23–24 additions"], "claim": "Records three withdrawals after a sign error and very recent complexity/optimization claims, including strongly polynomial LP and matrix multiplication exponent9/4.", "limitations": "Author-maintained history is not an independent proof review; November claims were not inspected at manuscript level.", "passageKind": "research-note", "note": "Records three withdrawals after a sign error and very recent complexity/optimization claims, including strongly polynomial LP and matrix multiplication exponent9/4.", "capture": "docs/field-atlas/sources/ai-mathematics/math-history.html", "sha256": "badbb8f33483c3ff2b41a062e9cf328d3214a8b38b3af7a3ce8fabce9166155d", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-25T06:26:44.391761+00:00", "domain": "ai-mathematics", "recordKind": "official-data", "sourceKind": "official-data"}</data></node><node id="ai-src-tao-review"><data key="title">Introducing MathHelm: A Place to discuss AI-generated papers</data><data key="kind">source</data><data key="domain">ai-mathematics</data><data key="status">selected-text</data><data key="metadata">{"id": "ai-src-tao-review", "title": "Introducing MathHelm: A Place to discuss AI-generated papers", "url": "https://terrytao.wordpress.com/2026/11/13/introducing-mathhelm-a-place-to-discuss-ai-generated-papers/", "authors": "MathHelm scientific committee, guest post hosted by Terence Tao", "year": 2026, "version": "Captured current page; exact byte identity retained", "kind": "source", "status": "selected-text", "readDepth": "Selected sections read; no comprehensive proof audit.", "sectionsRead": ["November13 2026 guest essay before comments/sidebar"], "claim": "Reports most of the October collection had not been verified by humans, encourages claim-specific discussion and rejects an obligation to review everything.", "limitations": "Broad scholarly response, not a verdict on each paper; guest authorship must not be attributed solely to Tao.", "passageKind": "research-note", "note": "R