ew research theorem, and not the same time conditions as contestants.", "passageKind": "research-note", "note": "AlphaProof/AlphaGeometry2 reportedly solved4/6 IMO2024 problems,28/42, with formal and geometry systems.", "capture": "docs/field-atlas/sources/ai-mathematics/alpha-proof.html", "sha256": "1fa4ff34d982b6ba10dec8a86df99567c7982b77a57dcbc7c47c6a497b276919", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-25T06:25:05.277320+00:00", "domain": "ai-mathematics", "recordKind": "official-announcement", "sourceKind": "official-announcement"}</data></node><node id="ai-src-anthropic-science"><data key="title">Claude-shaped science</data><data key="kind">source</data><data key="domain">ai-mathematics</data><data key="status">selected-text</data><data key="metadata">{"id": "ai-src-anthropic-science", "title": "Claude-shaped science", "url": "https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-shaped-science", "authors": "Matthew Schwartz, guest author; Anthropic host", "year": 2026, "version": "Captured current page; exact byte identity retained", "kind": "source", "status": "selected-text", "readDepth": "Selected sections read; no comprehensive proof audit.", "sectionsRead": ["BootLoops workflow and guest-author account of research assistance"], "claim": "Describes scientist-guided tools, expert consultation and cross-domain exploration rather than a clean theorem benchmark.", "limitations": "Not entered as a verified new mathematical theorem; source role differs from Anthropic’s independent First Proof participation.", "passageKind": "research-note", "note": "Describes scientist-guided tools, expert consultation and cross-domain exploration rather than a clean theorem benchmark.", "capture": "docs/field-atlas/sources/ai-mathematics/anthropic-science.html", "sha256": "01c68aba6aaf550ce1b1bdff1cdb61ca6da667d4df0d0642afac007794f96c8b", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-25T06:25:36.861156+00:00", "domain": "ai-mathematics", "recordKind": "official-announcement", "sourceKind": "official-announcement"}</data></node